---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: SELECT a FROM u WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM (SELECT a FROM t UNION ALL SELECT a FROM t) x WHERE x.a = u.a AND x.a > 2)
---
Join LeftSemi, (a#2 == a#0)
:- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#0]
+- Union
   :- Filter (a#2 > 2)
   :  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#2] (shared #1)
   +- Filter (a#2 > 2)
      +- Shared #1, printed above
